<h2 id="usage">Usage</h2>

<p><a href="https://helm.sh">Helm</a> must be installed to use the charts.
Please refer to Helm’s <a href="https://helm.sh/docs/">documentation</a> to get started.</p>

<p>Once Helm is set up properly, add the repo as follows:</p>

<div class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>helm repo add regulaforensics https://regulaforensics.github.io/helm-charts
helm repo update
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>You can then run <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">helm search repo regulaforensics</code> to see the charts.</p>

<ul>
  <li><a href="https://github.com/regulaforensics/helm-charts/tree/main/charts/docreader">Docreader</a></li>
